title: "FEMIC GNN Instance"
abstract: "A prototype FEMIC/ws4 model for the proposed Gwa'sala-'Nakwaxda'xw Nations Statement of Intent area, built from the TSA 46 and TSA 47 base models. The boundary, THLB, and AAC are provisional and non-legal."
